              <li>Top 10 Ways to get Rejected: <a href="https://www.slideshare.net/joaquimjorge94/top-10-ways-to-get-your-paper-rejected-at-cagjournal">https://www.slideshare.net/joaquimjorge94/top-10-ways-to-get-your-paper-rejected-at-cagjournal</a></li>
              <li>How to give a talk (german): <a href="https://www.cg.tuwien.ac.at/resources/onTalks/">https://www.cg.tuwien.ac.at/resources/onTalks/</a></li>
